              "2020M04": [
                "The temporary reduction in employers’ tax that applies from 1 March to 30 June has been taken into account. In March, there was no basis for calculating the effect on the Construction Cost index."
              ],
              "2020M05": [
                "The temporary reduction in employers’ tax that applies from 1 March to 30 June has been taken into account. In March, there was no basis for calculating the effect on the Construction Cost index."
              ],
              "2020M06": [
                "The temporary reimbursement for the entire sick pay cost that applies from 1 April to 31 July and the temporary reduction in employers’ costs that applies from 1 March to 30 June 2020 has been taken into account as from the second quarter of 2020. In March 2020, there was no basis for calculating the effect on Construction Cost index"
              ],
              "2020M07": [
                "The temporary reimbursement for the entire sick pay cost that applies from 1 April to 31 July and the temporary reduction in employers’ costs that applies from 1 March to 30 June 2020 has been taken into account as from the second quarter of 2020. In March 2020, there was no basis for calculating the effect on Construction Cost index"
              ]
